# Verification — prd/03-circus-tent.md (turn 17)

## Overall assessment

The file is a coherent, well-disciplined Circus Tent PRD that implements the developer prompt's Products direction (compatibility route versus Firefox-extension target, ModCDP pattern without porting Stagehand) while preserving the shared-contract and decision baselines without silent amendment. Epistemic tagging is thorough and spot-checks against sources and prior accepted files pass. Acceptable with only a cosmetic note; no revision needed before prd/04-ringmaster.md proceeds.

## Protocol, completeness, structure

- Raw deliverable (`runs/turn8-20/deliverables/turn17.md`) wraps content in a single fenced block annotated `markdown:prd/03-circus-tent.md` and closes with `<!-- TURN_END:17 -->`; no content outside the fence except the marker. Compliant.
